WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.104
Step 1. Choose what to print. You can print one diagnostic report,

1.2
00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:09.870
or all Final reports of a service request in one printout.

2.1
00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.300
Step 2. Open the print preview.

2.2
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.787
In the Diagnostic Reports tab, select the report and look at its status badge,

2.3
00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:23.351
since the printout does not show the status. Then select the Print icon.

3.1
00:00:23.351 --> 00:00:29.541
Step 3. Check the print preview. It shows the patient, the details and the results.

3.2
00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:34.693
Report Date is the date the report was created, without the time.

4.1
00:00:34.693 --> 00:00:41.479
Step 4. Print the diagnostic report. Print stays disabled until the PDF is ready.

4.2
00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:45.610
When it is enabled, select Print, or press P.

5.1
00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.268
Step 5. Leave the print preview.

5.2
00:00:48.268 --> 00:00:53.733
Select Back, or press Escape, to return to the page you came from.
